      "value": "原MLCR六层：Easy、Medium、Hard、Expert、Multi-part Compound、Compound Hallucination Check。AA当前页称使用最难两类expert/compound；v1.1博客称three difficult tiers，口径冲突照录，不强行统一。",
      "sources": [
